 directory of testing sites are among a wave of volunteers contributing to the virus fight.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/06/08/technology/coronavirus-test-sites-startups.html', 'snippet': 'Three start-up veterans who created an online directory of testing sites are among a wave of volunteers contributing to the virus fight.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For the past two months, the 9-to-5 jobs at their recruiting software company were just the start of a busy workday for Joe Essenfeld, Boris Kozak and Matt Geffken.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/26/business/00virus-dogooder3/00virus-dogooder3-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 307, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/05/26/business/00virus-dogooder3/00virus-dogooder3-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 307}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/26/business/00virus-dogooder3/00virus-dogooder3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 524, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/26/business/00virus-dogooder3/00virus-dogooder3-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1047, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/26/business/00virus-dogooder3/00virus-dogooder3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/05/26/business/00virus-dogooder3/00virus-dogooder3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption':