 far about some efforts to defund or abolish police departments.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MINNEAPOLIS — Across the country, calls are mounting from some activists and elected officials to defund, downsize or abolish police departments. A veto-proof majority of the Minneapolis City Council pledged on Sunday to dismantle the Minneapolis Police Department, promising to create a new system of public safety in a city where law enforcement has long been accused of racism.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/08/us/08UNREST-DEFUND-EXPLAINER/merlin_173282784_1d2f468d-363b-4c56-aa62-613959c85652-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/06/08/us/08UNREST-DEFUND-EXPLAINER/merlin_173282784_1d2f468d-363b-4c56-aa62-613959c85652-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/08/us/08UNREST-DEFUND-EXPLAINER/merlin_173282784_1d2f468d-363b-4c56-aa62-613959c85652-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/08/us/08UNREST-DEFUND-EXPLAINER/merlin_173282784_1d2f468d-363b-4c56-aa62-613959c85652-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/08/us/08UNREST-DEFUND-EXPLAINER/merlin_173282784_1d2f468d-363b-4c56-aa62-613959c85652-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/06/08/us/08UNREST-DEFUND-EXPLAINE