yt://interactive/e6694730-c72a-5173-ab0c-42d4c4e795f4'}, {'abstract': 'After a letter of protest from the newspaper’s union, Gerard Baker, now an editor at large, was reassigned to the opinion department.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/06/09/business/wall-street-journal-gerard-baker-editor.html', 'snippet': 'After a letter of protest from the newspaper’s union, Gerard Baker, now an editor at large, was reassigned to the opinion department.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Staff members of The Wall Street Journal sent a letter to newsroom leaders on Monday accusing the paper’s former editor in chief, Gerard Baker, who has been an editor at large at The Journal since leaving the top job in 2018, of violating rules that apply to those who work on the news side.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/09/business/09unrest-wsj1/merlin_161427696_784c3f01-d971-4f37-91ea-0a9a91d428cf-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/06/09/business/09unrest-wsj1/merlin_161427696_784c3f01-d971-4f37-91ea-0a9a91d428cf-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/09/business/09unrest-wsj1/merlin_161427696_784c3f01-d971-4f37-91ea-0a9a91d428cf-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/09/business/09unrest-wsj1/merlin_161427696_784c3f01-d971-4f37-91ea-0a9a91d428cf-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'ur