s answer to Art Nouveau. (Mr. Berman has been gathering them for decades, ever since a financial reversal forced him to stop collecting paintings.) Luckily the very same qualities that make for an effective poster — sharp edges, bold colors and graphic economy — work beautifully on a computer screen, so the gallery uploaded an extensive exhibition website, instead.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/12/arts/10virtual-galleries2/10virtual-galleries2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 903, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/06/12/arts/10virtual-galleries2/10virtual-galleries2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 903}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/12/arts/10virtual-galleries2/10virtual-galleries2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 681, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/12/arts/10virtual-galleries2/10virtual-galleries2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1361, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/12/arts/10virtual-galleries2/10virtual-galleries2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/06/12/arts/10virtual-galleries2/10virtual-galleries2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/12/arts/10virtual-galleries2/10virtual-galleries2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 