e90-4f37-57e0-8b79-15a29ba81486'}, {'abstract': 'Boaz Yakin’s movie is fresh in two ways: in its questioning of gender, and in its use of dance as a primary mode of expression.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/06/11/movies/aviva-review.html', 'snippet': 'Boaz Yakin’s movie is fresh in two ways: in its questioning of gender, and in its use of dance as a primary mode of expression.', 'lead_paragraph': 'At the heart of “Aviva” is a familiar love story between a man and a woman, with a familiar arc of romance, breakup and reconciliation. Yet in its first frames, the movie, written and directed by Boaz Yakin, announces several ways that the telling will be unusual. A naked woman looks at the camera and informs us that the character she plays is a man.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/10/arts/00aviva/merlin_173245341_98a3eef6-d92d-433c-80d1-884b76bbc174-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 428, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/06/10/arts/00aviva/merlin_173245341_98a3eef6-d92d-433c-80d1-884b76bbc174-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 428}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/10/arts/00aviva/merlin_173245341_98a3eef6-d92d-433c-80d1-884b76bbc174-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 731, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/10/arts/00aviva/merlin_173245341_98a3eef6-d92d-433c-80d1-884b76bbc174-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1278, 'width': 1791, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/10/arts/00aviva/merli