cues and rehabilitates wolf-dogs and uses those considered safe in programs to help at-risk youth. The couple then lived on the 28-acre wooded compound in a 30-foot trailer, without plumbing or electrical lines of its own.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/14/fashion/10Unions-WolfCouple1/merlin_172589013_f5b76439-02cb-4d7f-a02e-83b5c84b105a-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/06/14/fashion/10Unions-WolfCouple1/merlin_172589013_f5b76439-02cb-4d7f-a02e-83b5c84b105a-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/14/fashion/10Unions-WolfCouple1/merlin_172589013_f5b76439-02cb-4d7f-a02e-83b5c84b105a-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/14/fashion/10Unions-WolfCouple1/merlin_172589013_f5b76439-02cb-4d7f-a02e-83b5c84b105a-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/14/fashion/10Unions-WolfCouple1/10Unions-WolfCouple1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/06/14/fashion/10Unions-WolfCouple1/10Unions-WolfCouple1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/14/fashion/10Unions-WolfCouple1/10Unions-WolfCouple1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'heigh