General William P. Barr, there is scant evidence that loosely organized anti-fascists are a significant player in protests.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/06/11/us/antifa-protests-george-floyd.html', 'snippet': 'Despite claims by President Trump and Attorney General William P. Barr, there is scant evidence that loosely organized anti-fascists are a significant player in protests.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Inciting a riot. Hurling a Molotov cocktail. Plotting to sow destruction. Those are some of the most serious charges brought by federal prosecutors against demonstrators at protests across the country in recent weeks.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/10/us/10UNREST-ANTIFA-la/merlin_173182728_cd1a5374-60f8-40cc-80bb-19c16e8224a7-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/06/10/us/10UNREST-ANTIFA-la/merlin_173182728_cd1a5374-60f8-40cc-80bb-19c16e8224a7-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/10/us/10UNREST-ANTIFA-la/merlin_173182728_cd1a5374-60f8-40cc-80bb-19c16e8224a7-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/10/us/10UNREST-ANTIFA-la/merlin_173182728_cd1a5374-60f8-40cc-80bb-19c16e8224a7-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/10/us/10UNREST-ANTIFA-la/merlin_173182728_cd1a5374-60f8-40cc-80bb-19c16e8224a7-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width