b437391-daed-583a-ad0d-0a82b9225e65'}, {'abstract': 'In addition to declaring solidarity, the fast-food industry could make changes to protect the health and safety of black employees.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/06/11/dining/food-brands-black-lives-matter-social-media.html', 'snippet': 'In addition to declaring solidarity, the fast-food industry could make changes to protect the health and safety of black employees.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Last week, Gushers and Fruit by the Foot, two fruit candies from the 1990s, now manufactured by General Mills, joined forces on Twitter to announce a deep commitment to … something.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/12/dining/10food-brands-print/merlin_172000608_1f923a6b-e511-432c-8382-f0360c0a892c-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 426, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/06/12/dining/10food-brands-print/merlin_172000608_1f923a6b-e511-432c-8382-f0360c0a892c-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 426}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/12/dining/10food-brands-print/merlin_172000608_1f923a6b-e511-432c-8382-f0360c0a892c-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 727, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/12/dining/10food-brands-print/merlin_172000608_1f923a6b-e511-432c-8382-f0360c0a892c-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1454, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/12/dining/10food-brands-print/merlin_172000608_1f923a6b-e511-432c-8382-f0360c0a892c-thumbStand