ect', 'value': 'Coronavirus (2019-nCoV)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Holocaust and the Nazi Era', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'AMERICAN MUSEUM OF NATURAL HISTORY', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Konrad, Gyorgy (1933-2019)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Konrad Hawkins, Eva', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-06-11T17:42:14+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Obits', 'section_name': 'Obituaries', 'byline': {'original': 'By Corey Kilgannon', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Corey', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kilgannon', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/b9005227-39ae-54ef-bb4e-4cf361b0dc58', 'word_count': 539, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b9005227-39ae-54ef-bb4e-4cf361b0dc58'}, {'abstract': 'Pour yourself a cup of ambition and watch Dolly Parton, Jane Fonda and Lily Tomlin ignite a comic revolution against their boss, a “sexist, egotistical, lying, hypocritical bigot.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/06/11/movies/nine-to-five-dolly-parton.html', 'snippet': 'Pour yourself a cup of ambition and watch Dolly Parton, Jane Fonda and Lily Tomlin ignite a comic revolution against their boss, a “sexist, egotistical, lying, hypocritical bigot.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'With cities starting to reopen after months of pandemic-prescribed lockdown, people are talking about office life. The open-floor plan so beloved of managers is likely to be a thing of the past, replaced by Plexiglas barriers or work-from-home video links. These changes, combined with a spate of highly publicized worker revolts tied to diversity issues, suggest that the old office norms are under siege, which makes it seem like a good time to revisit “Nine to Five.”', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'mult