 then it was enveloped in a Philadelphia Black Lives Matter protest march and went viral.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On June 6, in Philadelphia’s Logan Square, outside a hotel that wasn’t even open and in the middle of a Black Lives Matter march, Michael Gordon was waiting for his wedding to begin.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/14/fashion/14perkins-gordonPhillyProtest2/merlin_173279469_2b0dff9f-bc76-4b3b-b12c-33e333df31ac-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/06/14/fashion/14perkins-gordonPhillyProtest2/merlin_173279469_2b0dff9f-bc76-4b3b-b12c-33e333df31ac-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/14/fashion/14perkins-gordonPhillyProtest2/merlin_173279469_2b0dff9f-bc76-4b3b-b12c-33e333df31ac-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/14/fashion/14perkins-gordonPhillyProtest2/merlin_173279469_2b0dff9f-bc76-4b3b-b12c-33e333df31ac-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1280, 'width': 1920, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/14/fashion/14perkins-gordonPhillyProtest2/merlin_173279469_2b0dff9f-bc76-4b3b-b12c-33e333df31ac-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/06/14/fashion/14perkins-gordonPhillyProtest2/merlin_173279469_2b0dff9f-bc76-4b3b-b12c-33e333df31ac-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheig