anization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a32d1dc4-4455-5798-a39b-2d6295a8ae06', 'word_count': 436, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a32d1dc4-4455-5798-a39b-2d6295a8ae06'}, {'abstract': 'A reckoning has come to Bon Appétit and the other magazines of Condé Nast. Can a culture built on elitism and exclusion possibly change?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/06/11/nyregion/anna-wintour-conde-nast-racism.html', 'snippet': 'A reckoning has come to Bon Appétit and the other magazines of Condé Nast. Can a culture built on elitism and exclusion possibly change?', 'lead_paragraph': 'On Monday, as swiftly as a 9-iron taken to a tee at Augusta, Adam Rapoport resigned as the editor in chief of Bon Appétit magazine after a damning Halloween photo circulated on social media that morning. Drawn from the vast insensitivity archives to which so many influential people have made inadvertent submissions, the picture, from 2004, shows him costumed in a tank top and thick chain necklace as his wife’s “papi,’’ the term she attached to it in an Instagram post several years later.', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/14/nyregion/14Big/merlin_160581933_ea8f355e-4474-4d2b-a345-76a4c81e7283-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 750, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/06/14/nyregion/14Big/merlin_160581933_ea8f355e-4474-4d2b-a345-76a4c81e7283-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 750}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/14/nyregion/14Big/merlin_160581933_ea8f355e-4474-4d2b-a345-76a4c81e7283-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 820, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 