nts on what so much togetherness has wrought.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/06/12/style/modern-love-coronavirus-living-together.html', 'snippet': 'After months of sheltering at home, 18 cohabitants on what so much togetherness has wrought.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It doesn’t take a Modern Love column to tell you that relationships can flourish — or wither — in times of stress. Add months of isolation, the physical and emotional toll of a pandemic, followed by global protests, and this period we’re living through has the capacity to reshape relationships on a broad scale.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/20/fashion/00TOGETHER-COMBO/00TOGETHER-COMBO-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 798, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/06/20/fashion/00TOGETHER-COMBO/00TOGETHER-COMBO-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 798}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/20/fashion/00TOGETHER-COMBO/00TOGETHER-COMBO-jumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 770, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/20/fashion/00TOGETHER-COMBO/00TOGETHER-COMBO-superJumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1539, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/20/fashion/00TOGETHER-COMBO/00TOGETHER-COMBO-thumbStandard-v4.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/06/20/fashion/00TOGETHER-COMBO/00TOGETHER-COMBO-thumbStandard-v4.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnail