traction. That’s a painful word when you’re talking about matters of life and death.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/06/12/sports/ncaafootball/george-floyd-protests-college-sports.html', 'snippet': '“Things that are important to African-Americans in a sports setting get labeled a distraction. That’s a painful word when you’re talking about matters of life and death.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'They knelt on campuses and outside courthouses and a capitol. They filmed videos and challenged coaches and gripped megaphones to call out racism they knew from their classrooms and stadiums. They led protest chants, registered voters and started to strategize for Nov. 3, Election Day.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/13/sports/00unrest-collegefootball1-print/merlin_161231535_319499fc-b80d-4ff6-89a4-966df4586dfc-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 486, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/06/13/sports/00unrest-collegefootball1-print/merlin_161231535_319499fc-b80d-4ff6-89a4-966df4586dfc-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 486}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/13/sports/00unrest-collegefootball1-print/merlin_161231535_319499fc-b80d-4ff6-89a4-966df4586dfc-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 830, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/13/sports/00unrest-collegefootball1-print/merlin_161231535_319499fc-b80d-4ff6-89a4-966df4586dfc-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1659, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/202