': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3bf53483-a044-5b9f-99b2-0c02c6fa4ff3', 'word_count': 1440, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3bf53483-a044-5b9f-99b2-0c02c6fa4ff3'}, {'abstract': 'He was applauded for broadening the bureau’s ranks to include more black, Hispanic and female agents. But many of his other actions drew severe criticism.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/06/12/us/william-s-sessions-dead.html', 'snippet': 'He was applauded for broadening the bureau’s ranks to include more black, Hispanic and female agents. But many of his other actions drew severe criticism.', 'lead_paragraph': 'William S. Sessions, a director of the F.B.I. under three presidents, from 1987 to 1993, who challenged racial and gender bias in his agency but struggled to redefine its mission in a time of domestic turmoil, and who was fired after being accused of ethical lapses, died on Friday in San Antonio. He was 90.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '25', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/13/obituaries/13Sessions-obit4/12Sessions4-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 397, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/06/13/obituaries/13Sessions-obit4/12Sessions4-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 397}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/13/obituaries/13Sessions-obit4/12Sessions4-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 678, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/13/obituaries/13Sessions-obit4/12Sessions4-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1356, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'capti