ount': 1308, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e7087c3e-98f3-510a-a8a7-b38a6192f10c'}, {'abstract': 'The silverback, known as Rafiki, was killed by a poacher with a spear, according to the Uganda Wildlife Authority. He was the leader of the famed Nkuringo gorilla group, which has been popular with tourists for decades.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/06/12/world/africa/rafiki-silverback-gorilla-poachers.html', 'snippet': 'The silverback, known as Rafiki, was killed by a poacher with a spear, according to the Uganda Wildlife Authority. He was the leader of the famed Nkuringo gorilla group, which has been popular with tourists for decades.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Four poachers were arrested this week in connection with the killing of a rare silverback gorilla in Uganda’s Bwindi Impenetrable National Park, a lush preserve of mist-shrouded hillsides and thick rain forests that is home to nearly half of the world’s mountain gorillas, the authorities said.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/12/us/12xp-rafiki-image2/12xp-rafiki-image2-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 408, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/06/12/us/12xp-rafiki-image2/12xp-rafiki-image2-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 408}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/12/us/12xp-rafiki-image2/12xp-rafiki-image2-jumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 657, 'width': 967, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/12/us/12xp-rafiki-image2/12xp-rafiki-image2-superJumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 657, 'width': 967, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'typ