views on American product design allowed him to stray into a wide range of cultural issues, including the battle for civil rights.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/06/15/arts/design/ralph-caplan-dead.html', 'snippet': 'A writer, editor and consultant, his views on American product design allowed him to stray into a wide range of cultural issues, including the battle for civil rights.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Ralph Caplan was the E.B. White of design writing. He disliked windy sentences and pompous clichés and was always ready to poke fun at orthodoxies. He said he wasn’t sure he saw the point of a chair, since human beings could sit on pretty much anything except a cactus.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/16/obituaries/12Caplan1/merlin_173473173_e2f0fd07-83c9-48df-8fda-9baa2ab44a3a-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 505, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/06/16/obituaries/12Caplan1/merlin_173473173_e2f0fd07-83c9-48df-8fda-9baa2ab44a3a-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 505}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/16/obituaries/12Caplan1/merlin_173473173_e2f0fd07-83c9-48df-8fda-9baa2ab44a3a-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 862, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/16/obituaries/12Caplan1/merlin_173473173_e2f0fd07-83c9-48df-8fda-9baa2ab44a3a-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1575, 'width': 1872, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/16/obituaries/12Caplan1/12Caplan1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 