eries to a couple after the e-commerce newsletter they published wrote about a lawsuit involving eBay.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BOXBOROUGH, Mass. — Six eBay employees mounted a cyberstalking campaign — including sending boxes of live cockroaches and a Halloween mask of a bloody pig’s face — against a couple who ran an online e-commerce newsletter, according to charges filed by federal prosecutors on Monday.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/15/business/15ebay-stalking1/merlin_173560710_7c6033ed-468c-42bc-8bec-7071cbb5ab86-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 417, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/06/15/business/15ebay-stalking1/merlin_173560710_7c6033ed-468c-42bc-8bec-7071cbb5ab86-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 417}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/15/business/15ebay-stalking1/merlin_173560710_7c6033ed-468c-42bc-8bec-7071cbb5ab86-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 711, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/15/business/15ebay-stalking1/merlin_173560710_7c6033ed-468c-42bc-8bec-7071cbb5ab86-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1423, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/15/business/15ebay-stalking1/15ebay-stalking1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/06/15/business/15ebay-stalking1/15ebay-stalking1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/15/business/15ebay-stalking1/15ebay-stalking1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Ex-eBay Workers Sent Critics Live Roaches and a Mask of a Bloody Pig Face, U.S. Says', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'U.S. Says Live Roaches Were Sent to eBay Critics', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computers and the Internet', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'eBay Inc', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wenig, Devin N', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Stalking (Crime)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cyberharassment', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Threats and Threatening Messages', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Suits and Litigation (Civil)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'E-Commerce', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lelling, Andrew', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Consumer Reviews', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Boston (Mass)', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Natick (Mass)', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Baugh, James', 'rank': 13, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Harville, David (1971- )', 'rank': 14, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-06-15T21:53:43+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'byline': {'original': 'By Natasha Singer', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Natasha', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Singer', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4bb4f72a-3f2b-5832-a6b2-f4a6aa298744', 'word_count': 819, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4bb4f72a-3f2b-5832-a6b2-f4a6aa298744'}, {'abstract': 'Drizzle this honey, from a South Carolina hot sauce maker, over chicken or pizza for a bit of heat.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/06/15/dining/red-clay-hot-honey.html', 'snippet': 'Drizzle this honey, from a South Carolina hot sauce maker, over chicken or pizza for a bit of heat.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Red Clay, a company in Charleston, S.C., specializes in hot sauces, and just a trace of their new honey will elevate chicken — preferably fried, though grilled or roasted will do — with a touch of mellowness that has subtle bite. There’s more upfront heat, along with a vegetal note, in the company’s Barrel Aged Hot-Hot Honey. Geoff Rhyne, a chef who is also the company’s hot sauce alchemist, uses the leftover habanero pepper mash from making his hot sauces (like the Carolina-style bolstered with vinegar, and a rich verde variety) to season the honeys.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/17/dining/15burner-honey/15burner-honey-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/06/17/dining/15burner-honey/15burner-honey-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/17/dining/15burner-honey/15burner-honey-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/17/dining/15burner-honey/15burner-honey-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1364, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/17/dining/15burner-honey/15burner-honey-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/06/17/dining/15burner-honey/15burner-honey-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/17/dining/15burner-honey/15burner-honey-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Hot Honey to Elevate Your Meal', 'kicker': 'Front Burner', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'To Drizzle: Hot Honey To Elevate Your Meal', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sauces', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Honey', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cooking and Cookbooks', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Red Clay Hot Sauce', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rhyne, Geoff', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-06-15T21:55:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Dining', 'section_name': 'Food', 'byline': {'original': 'By Florence Fabricant', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Florence', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fabricant', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b5715b82-f447-527d-ba40-06edfd9e7fa6', 'word_count': 138, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b5715b82-f447-527d-ba40-06edfd9e7fa6'}, {'abstract': 'The museum will also hold public programs to examine Avery Brundage’s legacy, as well as questions around restitution, and work on “decolonizing’’ the museum.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/06/15/arts/desig