': 'Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'International Relations', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Himalayas', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Politics and Government', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Modi, Narendra', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Xi Jinping', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Fatalities)', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Territorial Disputes', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-06-16T08:34:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jeffrey Gettleman, Hari Kumar and Sameer Yasir', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jeffrey', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gettleman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Hari', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kumar', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}, {'firstname': 'Sameer', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Yasir', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 3}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/210aa42a-a542-52dc-991c-a44d4c6f6fca', 'word_count': 1517, 'uri': 'nyt://article/210aa42a-a542-52dc-991c-a44d4c6f6fca'}, {'abstract': 'Wear a face mask, surgical gloves and a uniform or extra-large T-shirt over your clothes that you can peel off.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/06/16/magazine/how-to-clean-up-after-others.html', 'snippet': 'Wear a face mask, surgical gloves and a uniform or extra-large T-shirt over your clothes that you can peel off.', 'lead_paragraph': '“Protect yourself,” says Vanessa Oltmann, 63, who cleans vacation rentals in Folly Beach, S.C., and during her free time walks along the shore, picking up garbage left by beachgoers. The coronavirus has meant less paid cleaning work and much more detritus on the beach. “It’s just everywhere,” Oltmann says. “I don’t understand it.” If you’re cleaning up after strangers in a pandemic, take precautions: Wear a face mask, surgical gloves and a uniform or extra-large T-shirt over your clothes that you can peel off and put directly in the wash when you’re done. After every job, clean and sanitize your equipment, whether mops and brooms or garbage pickers and five-gallon buckets.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/21/magazine/21Mag-Tip-01/21Mag-Tip-01-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/06/21/magazine/21Mag-Tip-01/21Mag-Tip-01-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/21/magazine/21Mag-Tip-01/21Mag-Tip-01-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 900, 'width': 900, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/21/magazine/21Mag-Tip-01/21Mag-Tip-01-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 900, 'width': 900, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/21/magazine/21Mag-Tip-01/21Mag-Tip-01-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/06/21/magazine/21Mag-Tip-01/21Mag-Tip-01-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': '