e-c8e6-5cc8-a0ce-420914481c46'}, {'abstract': 'Gabriel Iglesias’s feel-good show returns for another season. And a paleontology series comes to PBS.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/06/17/arts/television/whats-on-tv-wednesday-mr-iglesias-and-prehistoric-road-trip.html', 'snippet': 'Gabriel Iglesias’s feel-good show returns for another season. And a paleontology series comes to PBS.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MR. IGLESIAS Stream on Netflix. Mr. Iglesias is back for another season, and this time, he is determined to get his underperforming students into college. The series is a homage to the high school alma mater of Gabriel Iglesias, the comedian who plays the title character: a history teacher heavily invested in the academic success and emotional well-being of his students. Though Iglesias is more recognized for his stand-up comedy than his acting, “He embodies Gabe’s sincerity and modesty in such a natural, unaffected way that he is almost egregiously likable,” Mike Hale wrote for The New York Times.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/17/arts/17tvcol-3/17tvcol-3-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 401, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/06/17/arts/17tvcol-3/17tvcol-3-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 401}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/17/arts/17tvcol-3/17tvcol-3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 684, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/17/arts/17tvcol-3/17tvcol-3-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1368, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption