t home, anxiously refreshing our browsers, knew that the decision had come down but could download only the first page of the headnote, the official summary: “Held: An employer who fires an individual merely for being gay or transgender violates Title VII.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/18/opinion/18greenhouseWeb/merlin_173559165_d54c96e0-7569-43d3-bdf4-a3a506fb0f98-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/06/18/opinion/18greenhouseWeb/merlin_173559165_d54c96e0-7569-43d3-bdf4-a3a506fb0f98-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/18/opinion/18greenhouseWeb/merlin_173559165_d54c96e0-7569-43d3-bdf4-a3a506fb0f98-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/18/opinion/18greenhouseWeb/merlin_173559165_d54c96e0-7569-43d3-bdf4-a3a506fb0f98-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/18/opinion/18greenhouseWeb/18greenhouseWeb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/06/18/opinion/18greenhouseWeb/18greenhouseWeb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/18/opinion/18greenhouseWeb/18greenhouseWeb-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name