y adviser, plans to publish a damning book next week depicting President Trump as a corrupt, poorly informed, reckless leader who used the power of his office to advance his own personal and political needs even ahead of the nation’s interests.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/18/us/politics/18dv-boltontakeaways-2/merlin_164802621_4be00c27-e949-4a09-a77e-7b3e8f41fe83-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/06/18/us/politics/18dv-boltontakeaways-2/merlin_164802621_4be00c27-e949-4a09-a77e-7b3e8f41fe83-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/18/us/politics/18dv-boltontakeaways-2/merlin_164802621_4be00c27-e949-4a09-a77e-7b3e8f41fe83-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/18/us/politics/18dv-boltontakeaways-2/merlin_164802621_4be00c27-e949-4a09-a77e-7b3e8f41fe83-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/18/us/politics/18dv-boltontakeaways-2/merlin_164802621_4be00c27-e949-4a09-a77e-7b3e8f41fe83-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/06/18/us/politics/18dv-boltontakeaways-2/merlin_164802621_4be00c27-e949-4a09-a77e-7b3e8f41fe83-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/202