ks ultimately complete their transactions.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/06/18/business/banks-black-customers-racism.html', 'snippet': 'Black customers risk being racially profiled on everyday visits to bank branches. Under federal laws, there is little recourse as long as the banks ultimately complete their transactions.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Clarice Middleton shook with fear as she stood on the sidewalk outside a Wells Fargo branch in Atlanta one December morning in 2018. Moments earlier, she had tried to cash a $200 check, only to be accused of fraud by three branch employees, who then called 911.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/19/us/19biz-banking/18biz-banking-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/06/19/us/19biz-banking/18biz-banking-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/19/us/19biz-banking/18biz-banking-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/19/us/19biz-banking/18biz-banking-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/19/us/19biz-banking/18biz-banking-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/06/19/us/19biz-banking/18biz-banking-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtyp