rus may prompt an increase in early voting.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/06/18/us/politics/trump-presidential-debates-2020.html', 'snippet': 'The Trump team wants one more debate than is typically held in the general election, and argued that they should start earlier because the coronavirus may prompt an increase in early voting.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Top aides to President Trump tried on Thursday to negotiate with the commission overseeing presidential debates to increase the number of times that Mr. Trump and former Vice President Joseph R. Biden Jr. face off in the fall.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/18/us/politics/18trump-debates/merlin_173591841_52203a9c-cef1-422a-99a0-e4f78e1528d8-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 415, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/06/18/us/politics/18trump-debates/merlin_173591841_52203a9c-cef1-422a-99a0-e4f78e1528d8-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 415}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/18/us/politics/18trump-debates/merlin_173591841_52203a9c-cef1-422a-99a0-e4f78e1528d8-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 707, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/18/us/politics/18trump-debates/merlin_173591841_52203a9c-cef1-422a-99a0-e4f78e1528d8-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1415, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/18/us/politics/18trump-debates/18trump-debates-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'im