ight” is still attracting big audiences, another sign of the nation’s political divide.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/06/18/business/media/tucker-carlson-advertisers-ratings.html', 'snippet': 'Amid a backlash and an ad boycott, “Tucker Carlson Tonight” is still attracting big audiences, another sign of the nation’s political divide.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In recent weeks, Tucker Carlson, the conservative Fox News host, has challenged the Black Lives Matter movement, dismissed demonstrators as “criminal mobs,” accused a Texas police chief of “sounding more like a therapist than a cop” and mocked a CNN children’s special about racism that featured Elmo, the “Sesame Street” puppet.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/19/business/18subunrest-tuckercarlson-print/merlin_170700699_df3e3f2c-b8e4-4376-8d0c-37f0672f16c1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/06/19/business/18subunrest-tuckercarlson-print/merlin_170700699_df3e3f2c-b8e4-4376-8d0c-37f0672f16c1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/19/business/18subunrest-tuckercarlson-print/merlin_170700699_df3e3f2c-b8e4-4376-8d0c-37f0672f16c1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/19/business/18subunrest-tuckercarlson-print/merlin_170700699_df3e3f2c-b8e4-4376-8d0c-37f0672f16c1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', '