: 'nyt://interactive/d7d5f6f5-3c35-5580-8415-cdfbdc1330cc'}, {'abstract': 'In recent months, we’ve been forced to reimagine how we gather, whether virtually or in person. Alicia Walters, a facilitator, artist and cultural innovator, believes that gathering in person (responsibly, of course) is essential, especially right now, for the black community.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/06/19/style/self-care/centering-blackness.html', 'snippet': '', 'lead_paragraph': 'In recent months, we’ve been forced to reimagine how we gather, whether virtually or in person. Alicia Walters, a facilitator, artist and cultural innovator, believes that gathering in person (responsibly, of course) is essential, especially right now, for the black community.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'What Does It Mean to ‘Center Black People’?', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Black People', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Blacks', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Discrimination', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'your-feed-selfcare', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Quarantine (Life and Culture)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Juneteenth', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-06-19T09:00:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Style', 'subsection_name': 'Self-Care', 'byline': {'original': 'By Siraad Dirshe', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Siraad', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Dirshe', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/10c2c526-df1f-5d8a-b1a7-cee21b272967', 'word_count': 1152, 'uri': 'nyt://article/10c2c526-df1f-5d8a-b1a7-cee21b272967'}, {'abstract': 'When my sons ask me about their grandfather, I tell them the truth: He helped make me a better father. I learned from his mistakes.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/06/19/well/family/fathers-day-parents.html', 'snippet': 'When my sons ask me about their grandfather, I tell them the truth: He helped make me a better father. I learned from his mistakes.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The first sound I heard on the phone was heavy, harsh breathing. Then the stranger introduced himself to me. “You don’t know me but my name is Sidney Moss … and I’m your father,” he said.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/18/science/00TIES-FATHERSDAY/00TIES-FATHERSDAY-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/06/18/science/00TIES-FATHERSDAY/00TIES-FATHERSDAY-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/18/science/00TIES-FATHERSDAY/00TIES-FATHERSDAY-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/18/science/00TIES-FATHERSDAY/00TIES-FATHERSDAY-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/18/science/00TIES-FATHERSDAY/00TIES-FATHERSDAY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/06/18/science/00TIES-FATHERSDAY/00TIES-FATHERSDAY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption':