with positive tests for some coronaviruses from the time they are trapped until they arrive on someone’s dinner plate.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/06/19/science/coronavirus-rats-vietnam.html', 'snippet': 'DNA tests show an increase in the number of animals with positive tests for some coronaviruses from the time they are trapped until they arrive on someone’s dinner plate.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A study of the wildlife trade in three provinces in southern Vietnam produced startlingly clear confirmation for one of the underlying objections to the wildlife trade in Asia — the trading offers an ideal opportunity for viruses in one animal to infect another.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/19/science/19VIRUS-WILDLIFE2/merlin_173677809_3f87ae90-0f8a-407e-ac31-6ac1296d35c2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 374, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/06/19/science/19VIRUS-WILDLIFE2/merlin_173677809_3f87ae90-0f8a-407e-ac31-6ac1296d35c2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 374}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/19/science/19VIRUS-WILDLIFE2/merlin_173677809_3f87ae90-0f8a-407e-ac31-6ac1296d35c2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 638, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/19/science/19VIRUS-WILDLIFE2/merlin_173677809_3f87ae90-0f8a-407e-ac31-6ac1296d35c2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1276, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/19/science/19VIRUS-WILDLIFE2/19VIRUS-WILDLIFE2-thumbStandard.j