rganization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1e80632f-020f-50b8-ac9b-731ca59d2f40', 'word_count': 781, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1e80632f-020f-50b8-ac9b-731ca59d2f40'}, {'abstract': 'Jon Stewart. Parenting black teenagers through protest and pandemic. The return of the platypuses. And more.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/06/19/arts/11-of-our-best-weekend-reads.html', 'snippet': 'Jon Stewart. Parenting black teenagers through protest and pandemic. The return of the platypuses. And more.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Welcome to the weekend. It’s the one when we celebrate dads and father figures. It comes after a week that brought two major decisions from the Supreme Court and a drug trial that seems to help the sickest coronavirus patients. So whether you’re honoring Dad, marking Pride or just hanging out, be sure to make time for some amazing journalism.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/20/multimedia/20weekend-reads-promo/20weekend-reads-promo-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/06/20/multimedia/20weekend-reads-promo/20weekend-reads-promo-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/20/multimedia/20weekend-reads-promo/20weekend-reads-promo-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/20/multimedia/20weekend-reads-promo/20weekend-reads-promo-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1334, 'width': 2000, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'im