, 'value': 'ALLIANCE FOR AGING RESEARCH', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elderly', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'your-feed-science', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'your-feed-health', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Aronson, Louise', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Drugs (Pharmaceuticals)', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-06-19T14:00:11+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Science', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By Paula Span', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Paula', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Span', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2c351df3-6fe6-5d75-835d-e48e9b0b5a98', 'word_count': 1229, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2c351df3-6fe6-5d75-835d-e48e9b0b5a98'}, {'abstract': 'The artist Ayana Evans has been making grueling, yet nuanced performances using her own body to help audiences understand what black women often face.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/06/19/arts/design/ayana-evans-black-women.html', 'snippet': 'The artist Ayana Evans has been making grueling, yet nuanced performances using her own body to help audiences understand what black women often face.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For her first official solo show in June 2018, the artist Ayana Evans was dressed in a skintight, neon green tiger-stripe catsuit, doing jumping jacks (in heels) or push-ups; then she challenged audience members to get down on the ground and do the push-ups with her. The audience at Medium Tings gallery in Brooklyn consisted of several artists, college friends and former students she had taught at Brown. The mood was jubilant; Ms. Evans gave everyone a hug at the end. In later performances she wore a floor-length gown, heels again and full makeup while going through the same calisthenic routines, until the makeup is washed away in a torrent of sweat and the artist almost melts into the floor. At other times she has popped up uninvited at exclusive events such as the Annual Black Ivy Alumni Gala wearing a fashionable dress and a sign pinned to her back that reads “I Just Came Here to Find a Husband.” There is no shame to her game.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/21/arts/21ayanaevans1/merlin_173469285_91f0f36d-9af7-4bfd-96b6-2b97d6ca094d-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 900, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/06/21/arts/21ayanaevans1/merlin_173469285_91f0f36d-9af7-4bfd-96b6-2b97d6ca094d-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 900}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/21/arts/21ayanaevans1/merlin_173469285_91f0f36d-9af7-4bfd-96b6-2b97d6ca094d-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 683, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/21/arts/21ayanaevans1/merlin_173469285_91f0f36d-9af7-4bfd-96b6-2b97d6ca094d-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1366, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/21/arts/21ayanaevans1/21ayanaevans1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/06/21/arts/21ayanaevans1/21ayanaevans1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/21/arts/21ayanaevans1/21ayanaevans1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'What It Takes to Raise a Black Woman Up', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Message Signaled via Jumping Jacks', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Black People', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Blacks', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Women and Girls', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Performance Art', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Discrimination', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': "Women's Rights", 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-06-19T14:00:12+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Arts&Leisure', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Art & Design', 'byline': {'original': 'By Seph Rodney', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Seph', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rodney', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/333613bb-75b8-5d28-b3bf-900ac26675da', 'word_count': 1766, 'uri': 'nyt://article/333613bb-75b8-5d28-b3bf-900ac26675da'}, {'abstract': 'A character actor who eventually took leading roles, Mr. Holm had a range that went from the sweet-tempered to the psychotic.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/06/19/obituaries/ian-holm-dead.html', 'snippet': 'A character actor who eventually took leading roles, Mr. Holm had a range that went from the sweet-tempered to the psychotic.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Ian Holm, a virtuosic British actor celebrated for his performances in plays by Shakespeare and Harold Pinter and in movies from Sidney Lumet’s “Night Falls on Manhattan” to the “Lord of the Rings” and “Hobbit” trilogies, died on Friday in London. He was 88.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/20/obituaries/20holm01/00holm01-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 818, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/06/20/obituaries/20holm01/00holm01-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 818}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/20/obituaries/20holm01/00holm01-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 752, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/20/obituaries/20holm01/00holm01-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1503, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/20/obituaries/20holm01/00holm01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/06/20/obituaries/20holm01/00holm01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/20/obituaries/20holm01/00holm01-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Ian Holm, Malleable Actor Who Played Lear and a Hobbit, Dies at 88', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Ian Holm, an Oscar Nominee Who Played Lear and a Hobbit, Is Dead at 88', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Holm, Ian', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ACTORS AND ACTRESSES', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'The Lord of the Rings (Movie)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'King Lear (Play)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-06-19T14:02:58+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Obits', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mel Gussow', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mel', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gussow', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/29d1a466-bed6-5092-9060-f57501f53deb', 'word_count': 1529, 'uri': 'nyt://article/29d1a466-bed6-5092-9060-f57501f53deb'}, {'abstract': 'For the first time since the 1970s, the final round of the tournament will not be played on the holiday. Our reporter reflects on what golf fans have lost — and he gained — this year.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/06/19/sports/golf/us-open-final-round-fathers-day.html', 'snippet': 'For the first time since the 1970s, the final round of the tournament will not be played on the holiday. Our reporter reflects on what golf fans have lost — and he gained — this year.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Starting in 2004, it became an annual expectation that I would not be home on Father’s Day. Don’t feel sorry for me, especially if you’re a golf fan. I was covering the final round of the United States Open, held on Father’s Day every year since 1976.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '35', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/21/sports/19golf-fathersday-web-3/merlin_70401077_2aaa26d4-2781-483c-b943-dc29ed1b280f-articleLarge