: 'nyt://article/3d18b5b4-422c-5336-9f7a-61ae7ea97f65'}, {'abstract': '“Sitting in Limbo,” a BBC drama, is inspired by one story from the “Windrush generation,” the British residents of Caribbean heritage who were mistakenly identified as illegal immigrants.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/06/19/arts/television/windrush-scandal-bbc.html', 'snippet': '“Sitting in Limbo,” a BBC drama, is inspired by one story from the “Windrush generation,” the British residents of Caribbean heritage who were mistakenly identified as illegal immigrants.', 'lead_paragraph': '“They don’t believe a word I say. They decided I’m a liar. They want me to be a liar.”', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/19/arts/19windrush1/merlin_173697969_10c94421-8314-44ff-94fb-8f96f425f26c-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/06/19/arts/19windrush1/merlin_173697969_10c94421-8314-44ff-94fb-8f96f425f26c-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/19/arts/19windrush1/merlin_173697969_10c94421-8314-44ff-94fb-8f96f425f26c-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/19/arts/19windrush1/merlin_173697969_10c94421-8314-44ff-94fb-8f96f425f26c-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/19/arts/19windrush1/19windrush1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name