ome.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/06/20/arts/television/whats-on-tv-saturday-babyteeth-great-american-groomalong.html', 'snippet': 'Eliza Scanlen stars in a new coming-of-age drama, and Carson Kressley hosts a special aimed at helping pet owners groom from home.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BABYTEETH (2019) Rent or buy on Amazon, Google Play, iTunes, Vudu, YouTube and pay TV operators. What if, at 16, you knew your first love could also possibly be your last? That’s the question at the heart of this family drama, which stars Eliza Scanlen as Milla, a teenager grappling with the onset of a serious, and possibly terminal, illness. As Milla’s parents (played by Ben Mendelsohn and Essie Davis) struggle to deal with their daughter’s diagnosis, they become even more alarmed when Milla brings home Moses (Toby Wallace), a homeless and drug addled 23-year-old. “He proves to be a prince in greasy threads,” Manohla Dargis writes in her review for The New York Times. “A sad-boy fantasy who proves as pure-hearted as Milla, or rather as the story needs him to be.”', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/20/arts/20tvcol-babyteeth/merlin_173481084_d742ba16-ebc3-4393-a174-bf7b2e638ba3-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/06/20/arts/20tvcol-babyteeth/merlin_173481084_d742ba16-ebc3-4393-a174-bf7b2e638ba3-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/20/arts/20tvcol-babyteeth/merlin_173481084_d742ba16-ebc3-4393-a174-bf7b2e638ba3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'ur