table and trained by the 82-year-old Barclay Tagg.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/06/20/sports/horse-racing/belmont-stakes-triple-crown-tiz-the-law.html', 'snippet': 'Tiz the Law is a New York-bred colt owned by Sackatoga Stable and trained by the 82-year-old Barclay Tagg.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Life is strange these days. We wear face masks, stand six feet apart, and have reluctantly become experts at video conferencing into meetings. Sports are trying to come back in stutter-steps. So it was kind of nice, if even normal, to watch the racehorse Tiz the Law turn in a transcendent performance in the 152nd running of the Belmont Stakes.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '32', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/21/sports/20belmont1-print/20belmont1-print-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/06/21/sports/20belmont1-print/20belmont1-print-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/21/sports/20belmont1-print/20belmont1-print-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/21/sports/20belmont1-print/20belmont1-print-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/21/sports/20belmont1-print/20belmont1-print-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/06/21/sports/20belmont1-print/20belmont1-p