'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Assn of Stock Car Auto Racing', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wallace, Darrell Jr', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'ALABAMA', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-06-22T04:49:40+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Express', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By Azi Paybarah and Aimee Ortiz', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Azi', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Paybarah', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Aimee', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ortiz', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/008676d5-264e-52d3-b87d-d94cb9ffb0da', 'word_count': 672, 'uri': 'nyt://article/008676d5-264e-52d3-b87d-d94cb9ffb0da'}, {'abstract': 'Jacques Rivette’s nearly 13-hour opus is available in its entirety on Mubi. And a competition show for magicians begins its seventh season.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/06/22/arts/television/whats-on-tv-monday-out-1-penn-and-teller-fool-us.html', 'snippet': 'Jacques Rivette’s nearly 13-hour opus is available in its entirety on Mubi. And a competition show for magicians begins its seventh season.', 'lead_paragraph': 'OUT 1: NOLI ME TANGERE (2015) Stream on Mubi. Jacques Rivette’s film from the early 1970s is difficult to summarize, in part because it revolves around the question of whether or not plots actually exist. The main story threads — two separate theater troupes rehearsing different plays by the Greek tragedian Aeschylus: one about a young man hunting for a secret society called the Thirteen; the other about a canny hustler who stumbles across the shadowy cabal — are woven together only to be unraveled. The conspiracy that Colin (Jean-Pierre Léaud) is seeking to uncover, which Frédérique (Juliet Berto) discovers by accident, is similarly ambiguous. It appears to exist — Frédérique seems to find correspondence between its members, and several avowed participants appear in the film — but its power and status are unclear. This tension is never resolved, but over the course of the film’s more than 12 hours, it deepens and becomes more complex.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/22/arts/22tvcol-1/22tvcol-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/06/22/arts/22tvcol-1/22tvcol-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 338}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/22/arts/22tvcol-1/22tvcol-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 576, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/22/arts/22tvcol-1/22tvcol-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1080, 'width': 1920, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/22/arts/22tvcol-1/22tvcol-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/06/22/arts/22tvcol-1/22tvcol-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/22/arts/22tvcol-1/22tvcol-1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'What’s on TV Monday: ‘Out 