 'uri': 'nyt://article/fd5a6c72-21b8-5a8a-a464-86978626ad8e'}, {'abstract': 'Dream of restaurants, then cook for ease and deliciousness.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/06/22/dining/what-to-cook-right-now.html', 'snippet': 'Dream of restaurants, then cook for ease and deliciousness.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Good morning. I had a dream I was in Dan Tana’s in Los Angeles and the place was packed. There was no coronavirus pandemic, just sweating martinis and jovial laughter, and I persuaded my guest to order the shrimp parmigiana: best thing on the menu, exactly the sort of thing you’d never make at home. The shrimp was delicious in my dream, but those words — “at home” — brought reality into my consciousness. Things went circular. I woke up in a sweat.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/15/dining/jg-strawberry-biscuits/merlin_173545854_5ce343dc-28e8-43ce-8b32-86cb99c9b9fc-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 480, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/06/15/dining/jg-strawberry-biscuits/merlin_173545854_5ce343dc-28e8-43ce-8b32-86cb99c9b9fc-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 480}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/15/dining/jg-strawberry-biscuits/merlin_173545854_5ce343dc-28e8-43ce-8b32-86cb99c9b9fc-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 819, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/15/dining/jg-strawberry-biscuits/merlin_173545854_5ce343dc-28e8-43ce-8b32-86cb99c9b9fc-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1638, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/20