rop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/06/21/us/00unrest-angst-1/21unrest-mississippi-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/21/us/00unrest-angst-1/21unrest-mississippi-1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'White Americans Say They Are Waking Up to Racism. What Will It Add Up To?', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'White and Awakened to Racism,  And Wondering What to Do Next', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'George Floyd Protests (2020)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Race and Ethnicity', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Black Lives Matter Movement', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Whites', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Police Brutality, Misconduct and Shootings', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Discrimination', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-06-22T17:01:44+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Amy Harmon and Audra D. S. Burch', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Amy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Harmon', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Audra', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/24eb32de-279b-50b9-85af-8dc144befbd4', 'word_count': 1717, 'uri': 'nyt://article/24eb32de-279b-50b9-85af-8dc144befbd4'}, {'abstract': 'The collaboration is a new piece of César’s legacy, and of the larger history of artists making jewelry.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/06/22/t-magazine/celine-cesar-jewelry.html', 'snippet': 'The collaboration is a new piece of César’s legacy, and of the larger history of artists making jewelry.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For someone whose monumental sculptures regularly required the use of a large-scale hydraulic press, the 20th-century French-born artist César Baldaccini — known during his lifetime simply as César — could seem breezy about materials and the toils of craftsmanship: “I take some matter, and I make something,” he once told an interviewer. “I could be a baker, making bread.” Clearly, what was paramount for him was the mere fact of creation. And although he’s most famous for his use of crushed-up cars and other junkyard parts, scrap iron having proved affordable when he was starting out and had little money, he also worked with polyurethane and newspaper — and even made jewelry. This month, Celine is reviving that lesser-known element of his practice with the launch of a roughly two-and-a-half-inch-tall version of one of César’s compression pendants: a rectangular column made up of small sheets and bands of metal that fold in and around each other in a gleaming maze.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/22/t-magazine/22tmag-celine-jewelry-slide-horizontal/22tmag-celine-jewelry-slide-horizontal-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/06/22/t-magazine/22tmag-celine-jewelry-slide-horizontal/22tmag-celine-jewelry-slide-horizontal-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/22/t-magazine/22tmag-celine-jewelry-slide-horizontal/22tmag-celine-jewelry-slide-horizontal-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/22/t-magazine/22tmag-celine-jewelry-slide-horizontal/22tmag-celine-jewelry-slide-horizontal-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1000, 'width': 1500, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/22/t-magazine/22tmag-celine-jewelry-slide-horizontal/22tmag-celine-jewelry-slide-horizontal-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/06/22/t-magazine/22tmag-celine-jewelry-slide-horizontal/22tmag-celine-jewelry-slide-horizontal-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/22/t-magazine/22tmag-celine-jewelry-slide-horizontal/22tmag-celine-jewelry-slide-horizontal-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'From Celine, a Pendant Designed by a Sculptor', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Gold', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Jewels and Jewelry', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sculpture', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Celine (Fashion Label)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-06-22T17:03:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Lizzie Feidelson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Lizzie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Feidelson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/79c6c07a-56a3-5d27-a9d5-09dd6a267159', 'word_count': 1107, 'uri': 'nyt://article/79c6c07a-56a3-5d27-a9d5-09dd6a267159'}, {'abstract': 'The Atlanta rapper’s “My Turn,” released in March, is only the third album of 2020 to hold the top spot on Billboard’s chart for three weeks.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/06/22/arts/music/lil-baby-my-turn-no-1.html', 'snippet': 'The Atlanta rapper’s “My Turn,” released in March, is only the third album of 2020 to hold the top spot on Billboard’s chart for three weeks.', 'lead_paragraph': 'At one point in his career, the 25-year-old Atlanta rapper Lil Baby earned cachet as a reluctant hip-hop star — he avoided the limelight even while churning out mountains of content, and was known to swing by the local Chick-fil-A unaccompanied.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/24/arts/22billboard/merlin_169929396_7f50e27a-fb3c-4daa-844a-7a230e0d5906-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 403, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/06/24/arts/22billboard/merlin_169929396_7f50e27a-fb3c-4daa-844a-7a230e0d5906-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 403}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/24/arts/22billboard/merlin_169929396_7f50e27a-fb3c-4daa-844a-7a230e0d5906-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 688, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/24/arts/22billboard/merlin_169929396_7f50e27a-fb3c-4daa-844a-7a230e0d5906-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1375, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'sup