 like Key lime pie but they’re so much easier to share (and easier to make).', 'lead_paragraph': 'Traditionally, Key lime pie is made from Key limes, also known as Mexican or West Indian limes. They’re smaller and seedier than conventional limes, and their aromatic juice more sour. Combined with super-sweet condensed milk, egg yolks and a graham cracker crust, that juice makes a terrific pie.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/08/09/dining/seneviratne_limebars_horizontal/merlin_141910329_66938d51-b211-4137-9a83-2aef34090ca8-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/08/09/dining/seneviratne_limebars_horizontal/merlin_141910329_66938d51-b211-4137-9a83-2aef34090ca8-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/08/09/dining/seneviratne_limebars_horizontal/merlin_141910329_66938d51-b211-4137-9a83-2aef34090ca8-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/08/09/dining/seneviratne_limebars_horizontal/merlin_141910329_66938d51-b211-4137-9a83-2aef34090ca8-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/08/09/dining/seneviratne_limebars_horizontal/seneviratne_limebars_horizontal-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/08/09/dining/seneviratne_limebars_horizontal/seneviratne_limebars_horizontal-