one, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Patient Protection and Affordable Care Act (2010)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Health Insurance and Managed Care', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Coronavirus (2019-nCoV)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Republican Party', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Democratic Party', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pelosi, Nancy', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections, Senate', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2020', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'House of Representatives', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections, House of Representatives', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-06-23T00:05:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Washington', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sheryl Gay Stolberg', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sheryl', 'middlename': 'Gay', 'lastname': 'Stolberg', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f4dee37c-cba2-5139-9420-98ddd37c1cd2', 'word_count': 1471, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f4dee37c-cba2-5139-9420-98ddd37c1cd2'}, {'abstract': 'Avec, a new juice-based soft drink, comes in five flavors and pairs well with tequila, gin or vodka.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/06/22/dining/avec-drinks-fruit-soda.html', 'snippet': 'Avec, a new juice-based soft drink, comes in five flavors and pairs well with tequila, gin or vodka.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Tonic water and soda water can easily outfit the bar when fizz is required. But a new collection of juice-based soft drinks, designed as cocktail mixers, is worth adding to the setup. Avec, a Brooklyn-based company, was created by Alex Doman, an English food and beverage consultant, and Denetrias Charlemagne, an advertising executive, with the goal of keeping sugar low and ingredients pure and simple. There are five soda flavors: grapefruit and pomelo, with black pepper, vanilla and smoked salt; ginger, with pineapple and lime juices, agave, molasses and allspice; yuzu and lime, with lemongrass; jalapeño and blood orange, with calamansi, lime and smoked salt; and hibiscus and pomegranate, with lime and cinnamon. Tequila, gin and vodka are the most compatible with the sodas.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/24/dining/22BurnerSoda/22BurnerSoda-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 337, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/06/24/dining/22BurnerSoda/22BurnerSoda-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 337}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/24/dining/22BurnerSoda/22BurnerSoda-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 576, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/24/dining/22BurnerSoda/22BurnerSoda-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 916, 'width': 1629, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/24/dining/22BurnerSoda/22BurnerSoda-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/06/24/dining/22BurnerSoda/22BurnerSoda-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/24/dining/22BurnerSoda/22BurnerSoda-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'These Complete a Spirit', 'kicker': 'Front Burner', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'To Mix: These Complete A Spirit With a Fizz', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Soft Drinks', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cocktails and Mixed Drinks', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Avec Drinks Co', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-06-23T00:08:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Dining', 'section_name': 'Food', 'byline': {'original': 'By Florence Fabricant', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Florence', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fabricant', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f5a2de85-0ca2-5640-8552-89ecb2b32bf8', 'word_count': 158, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f5a2de85-0ca2-5640-8552-89ecb2b32bf8'}, {'abstract': 'Mondiants, the chocolatier Christopher Curtin’s latest creation, iterate on a sweet idea.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/06/22/dining/eclat-chocolate-mondiants.html', 'snippet': 'Mondiants, the chocolatier Christopher Curtin’s latest creation, iterate on a sweet idea.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Mendiants are usually slabs of chocolate with nuts and dried fruit scattered on top. At Éclat Chocolate, the chocolatier Christopher Curtin has come up with a new variation he’s calling Mondiants: decoratively embossed wafer-thin chocolate disks with various fillings. The choices are dark chocolate, with fillings of cacao nibs or caramel, and milk chocolate, with a peanut butter filling.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/24/dining/24Burner-Candy-Eclat-Choco-a/24Burner-Candy-Eclat-Choco-a-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/06/24/dining/24Burner-Candy-Eclat-Choco-a/24Burner-Candy-Eclat-Choco-a-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/24/dining/24Burner-Candy-Eclat-Choco-a/24Burner-Candy-Eclat-Choco-a-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/24/dining/24Burner-Candy-Eclat-Choco-a/24Burner-Candy-Eclat-Choco-a-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/24/dining/24Burner-Candy-Eclat-Choco-a/24Burner-Candy-Eclat-Choco-a-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/06/24/dining/24Burner-Candy-Eclat-Choco-a/24Burner-Candy-Eclat-Choco-a-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/24/dining/24Burner-Candy-Eclat-Choco-a/24Burner-Candy-Eclat-Choco-a-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Play on Chocolate', 'kicker': 'Front Burner', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'To Indulge: A Play on Chocolate By Christopher Curtin', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Eclat Chocolate', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Chocolate', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-06-23T00:11:21+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Dining', 'section_name': 'Food', 'byline': {'original': 'By Florence Fabricant', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Florence', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fabricant', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6b2ce226-597f-51a4-9d1b-5f012f966e36', 'word_count': 89, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6b2ce226-597f-51a4-9d1b-5f012f966e36'}, {'abstract': 'Pescatore in Grand Central Market ships eight varieties of its seafood-filled rolls nationwide.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/06/22/dining/pescatore-summer-rolls.html', 'snippet': 'Pescatore in Grand Central Market ships eight varieties of its seafood-filled rolls nationwide.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Pescatore Seafood, a long-established fish shop in Grand Central Market, now ships its bounty fresh nationwide. It’s also available for pickup and delivery in New York. Though you might not need Pescatore for lump crab meat or red snapper fillets, you could use its assortment of summer rolls stuffed with seafood and vegetables as an easy route to warm weather entertaining. There are eight options: three made with shrimp, and also tuna, Chilean sea bass, lobster, grilled salmon and soft-shell crab, a seasonal special.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/24/dining/22burner-roll/22burner-roll-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 392, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'ima