’t underestimate its power, either.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/06/23/magazine/how-to-rename-a-street.html', 'snippet': 'Changing street names cannot fix injustice, but don’t underestimate its power, either.', 'lead_paragraph': '“Notice the hidden curriculum that runs through place names,” says Derek H. Alderman, a professor of geography at the University of Tennessee. Ask who and what the street names around you commemorate. Place names often reinforce colonialist narratives, erase Indigenous history and inscribe privilege onto the landscape. Toponyms reflect points of view, which can be changed.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/28/magazine/28Mag-Tip-01/28Mag-Tip-01-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 483, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/06/28/magazine/28Mag-Tip-01/28Mag-Tip-01-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 483}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/28/magazine/28Mag-Tip-01/28Mag-Tip-01-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 738, 'width': 916, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/28/magazine/28Mag-Tip-01/28Mag-Tip-01-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 738, 'width': 916, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/28/magazine/28Mag-Tip-01/28Mag-Tip-01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/06/28/magazine/28Mag-Tip-01/28Mag-Tip-01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 's