: 'nyt://article/4efccfdb-8fb2-5952-a349-dbb2f3156526'}, {'abstract': 'Cross River has cranked out more loans under the federal Paycheck Protection Program than all but three of the country’s biggest lenders.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/06/23/business/paycheck-protection-program-cross-river-bank.html', 'snippet': 'Cross River has cranked out more loans under the federal Paycheck Protection Program than all but three of the country’s biggest lenders.', 'lead_paragraph': 'From its address on the west side of the Hudson River to its tiny balance sheet, Cross River Bank is nothing like Manhattan’s Wall Street behemoths. But as part of the government’s efforts to stave off an economic catastrophe, it stands among giants.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/22/business/00crossriver1/merlin_173600859_c0853377-9ba7-42f9-ac90-9c16edec881d-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/06/22/business/00crossriver1/merlin_173600859_c0853377-9ba7-42f9-ac90-9c16edec881d-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 450}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/22/business/00crossriver1/merlin_173600859_c0853377-9ba7-42f9-ac90-9c16edec881d-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/22/business/00crossriver1/merlin_173600859_c0853377-9ba7-42f9-ac90-9c16edec881d-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1536, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/22/busin