, 'uri': 'nyt://article/604a07ef-c564-50bc-9b54-bf1c961f8fa9'}, {'abstract': 'Inequality, densely packed cities, legions of informal workers and weak health care systems have undermined efforts to fight the pandemic, as some governments have fumbled the response.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/06/23/world/americas/coronavirus-brazil-mexico-peru-chile-uruguay.html', 'snippet': 'Inequality, densely packed cities, legions of informal workers and weak health care systems have undermined efforts to fight the pandemic, as some governments have fumbled the response.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MEXICO CITY — By late March, the Mexican government calmly predicted that its coronavirus outbreak would peak in April.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/23/world/23virus-latam-brazil/merlin_173821893_13123362-9c9d-49e1-bad9-975b114a1a62-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/06/23/world/23virus-latam-brazil/merlin_173821893_13123362-9c9d-49e1-bad9-975b114a1a62-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/23/world/23virus-latam-brazil/merlin_173821893_13123362-9c9d-49e1-bad9-975b114a1a62-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/23/world/23virus-latam-brazil/merlin_173821893_13123362-9c9d-49e1-bad9-975b114a1a62-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/23/world/23vir