': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/06/23/style/tiny-modern-love-stories-coronavirus-i-googled-crisis.html', 'snippet': 'Modern Love in miniature, featuring reader-submitted stories of no more than 100 words.', 'lead_paragraph': 'My boyfriend and I often fight about dishes. One night, post-fight, I remembered reading an article with the headline, “Fighting About the Dishes? It Might Be About Something Else.” The mandatory confinement in our small Berlin apartment created a crisis in our relationship. The entire world seemed to be in crisis, too. Anxious, I Googled “crisis.” It was characterized as a “crossroad,” a “turning point when an important change takes place.” I relaxed, realizing that our situation could be a chance for a better start, both for our relationship and the world. — Natalia Lomaia', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/07/06/fashion/06TINYLOVE-illo3/06TINYLOVE-illo3-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/07/06/fashion/06TINYLOVE-illo3/06TINYLOVE-illo3-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/07/06/fashion/06TINYLOVE-illo3/06TINYLOVE-illo3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/07/06/fashion/06TINYLOVE-illo3/06TINYLOVE-illo3-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/07/06/fashion/06TINYLOVE-illo3/06TINYLOVE-illo3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop