b1d6937'}, {'abstract': 'A strategy of raising and de-escalating tensions has long been part of the North’s way of gaining leverage. By staying the hand of hard-liners, Kim Jong-un appeared to be leaving room for diplomacy.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/06/24/world/asia/north-koreas-troops-border-south-korea.html', 'snippet': 'A strategy of raising and de-escalating tensions has long been part of the North’s way of gaining leverage. By staying the hand of hard-liners, Kim Jong-un appeared to be leaving room for diplomacy.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SEOUL, South Korea — North Korea’s leader, Kim Jong-un, has overruled his military’s plans to resume exercises and deploy more troops near the heavily armed border with South Korea, using his authority to de-escalate rising tensions on the Korean Peninsula, the North’s official news agency reported on Wednesday.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/24/world/24nkorea/merlin_173606361_153cbc9b-c8e6-4381-8b4b-300f21bdb13c-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 413, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/06/24/world/24nkorea/merlin_173606361_153cbc9b-c8e6-4381-8b4b-300f21bdb13c-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 413}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/24/world/24nkorea/merlin_173606361_153cbc9b-c8e6-4381-8b4b-300f21bdb13c-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 704, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/24/world/24nkorea/merlin_173606361_153cbc9b-c8e6-4381-8b4b-300f21bdb13c-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1409, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'c