lix. And a spinoff wraps up on Lifetime.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/06/24/arts/television/whats-on-tv-wednesday-athlete-a-married-at-first-sight.html', 'snippet': 'A documentary about U.S.A. Gymnastics debuts on Netflix. And a spinoff wraps up on Lifetime.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ATHLETE A (2020) Stream on Netflix. In August 2016, The Indianapolis Star published an investigation into U.S.A. Gymnastics, which failed to report sexual assault accusations about several of its coaches. Not long after, the newspaper reported accusations of repeated sexual assault against Lawrence G. Nassar, a doctor who treated hundreds of young women and girls, many of whom were on the U.S. Olympic and World Championships teams. This documentary follows the reporters who broke the story, chronicling the hurdles they faced as they sought to expose U.S.A. Gymnastics, and features Maggie Nichols, a gymnast who helped bring these accusations to light.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/24/arts/24tvcol-1/24tvcol-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/06/24/arts/24tvcol-1/24tvcol-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/24/arts/24tvcol-1/24tvcol-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/24/arts/24tvcol-1/24tvcol-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/24/a