pted Michelle McNamara’s true-crime best seller about the Golden State Killer, “I’ll Be Gone in the Dark," into an HBO  series.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/06/24/arts/television/golden-state-killer-hbo-documentary.html', 'snippet': 'The director has adapted Michelle McNamara’s true-crime best seller about the Golden State Killer, “I’ll Be Gone in the Dark," into an HBO  series.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Hollywood may love neat, cathartic resolutions, but the filmmaker Liz Garbus has always been drawn to open-ended stories. “You have to deal a little bit with the discomfort of the gray areas in the world,” she said in a recent phone conversation.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/28/arts/21GARBUS1/merlin_173121171_2ed9ebb1-6121-4182-8483-f41d8558fdbf-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 750, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/06/28/arts/21GARBUS1/merlin_173121171_2ed9ebb1-6121-4182-8483-f41d8558fdbf-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 750}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/28/arts/21GARBUS1/merlin_173121171_2ed9ebb1-6121-4182-8483-f41d8558fdbf-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 820, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/28/arts/21GARBUS1/merlin_173121171_2ed9ebb1-6121-4182-8483-f41d8558fdbf-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1639, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/28/arts/21GARBUS1/21GARBUS1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thu