andemic, and some are turning to their families for help. That can aggravate some awkward dynamics.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/06/24/business/lending-money-to-family-coronavirus.html', 'snippet': 'Many Americans have lost work in the pandemic, and some are turning to their families for help. That can aggravate some awkward dynamics.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As a financial adviser, Elyse Foster helps clients navigate tricky personal issues around managing their money. But the coronavirus has brought an extra layer of complexity — especially where family is concerned.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/19/business/19Virus-FamilyLending-01sub/merlin_173674839_947c4426-9c36-47a3-bd65-aedbfe434895-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 480, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/06/19/business/19Virus-FamilyLending-01sub/merlin_173674839_947c4426-9c36-47a3-bd65-aedbfe434895-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 480}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/19/business/19Virus-FamilyLending-01sub/merlin_173674839_947c4426-9c36-47a3-bd65-aedbfe434895-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 819, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/19/business/19Virus-FamilyLending-01sub/merlin_173674839_947c4426-9c36-47a3-bd65-aedbfe434895-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1638, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/19/business/19Virus-FamilyLending-01sub/19Virus-FamilyLending-01sub-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width