_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/06/24/us/confederate-statues-photos.html', 'snippet': 'Statues and monuments that have long honored racist figures are being boxed up, spray-painted — or beheaded.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The statues have stood for more than a century in some places. Some are cast in bronze, others carved in stone. And all over the world, as protests against racism and police violence have renewed attention on legacies of injustices, people have been asking: Does this statue still need to be here?', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/26/us/26xp-statues/merlin_173403453_a76b38bc-67bf-4ba0-b86b-86476c49eaa3-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/06/26/us/26xp-statues/merlin_173403453_a76b38bc-67bf-4ba0-b86b-86476c49eaa3-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/26/us/26xp-statues/merlin_173403453_a76b38bc-67bf-4ba0-b86b-86476c49eaa3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/26/us/26xp-statues/merlin_173403453_a76b38bc-67bf-4ba0-b86b-86476c49eaa3-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/26/us/26xp-statues/26xp-statues-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/06/26/us/26xp-statues/26xp-statues-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnai