e. As the scene continues, a woman speaks in voice-over. “The world is fascinating and beautiful.” Our girl has hit several rough patches, but from the way she keeps looking at the world you know she’ll be OK.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/26/arts/00houseofhummingbird/merlin_173717040_1e0e04c3-2fb3-449c-a298-1f5e378de3b2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 324, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/06/26/arts/00houseofhummingbird/merlin_173717040_1e0e04c3-2fb3-449c-a298-1f5e378de3b2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 324}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/26/arts/00houseofhummingbird/merlin_173717040_1e0e04c3-2fb3-449c-a298-1f5e378de3b2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 553, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/26/arts/00houseofhummingbird/merlin_173717040_1e0e04c3-2fb3-449c-a298-1f5e378de3b2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1037, 'width': 1920, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/26/arts/00houseofhummingbird/00houseofhummingbird-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/06/26/arts/00houseofhummingbird/00houseofhummingbird-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/26/arts/00houseofhummingbird/00houseofhummingbird-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 't