rn and contemporary art on the peninsula.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/06/25/arts/design/korean-modern-art-book.html', 'snippet': '“Korean Art From 1953,” a lavish new book, is the most significant English-language overview yet of modern and contemporary art on the peninsula.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Many rich nations use art, music and movies to project an image to the world, but few take it as seriously as South Korea — today’s uncontested champion of cultural soft power. In the last 20 years, the nation’s singers and actors have thumped to Asian and then worldwide superstardom — signaled in 2012 by the viral amusement “Gangnam Style” (the first song to hit a billion views on YouTube); strengthened by the stadium-filling concerts of BTS, Loona and other K-pop bands; and capped recently by the unprecedented best picture Oscar for Bong Joon Ho’s “Parasite.”', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/26/arts/18koreanart-notebook01/merlin_173595993_d2308854-af52-407b-a6c9-1e8f92b04a8c-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 461, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/06/26/arts/18koreanart-notebook01/merlin_173595993_d2308854-af52-407b-a6c9-1e8f92b04a8c-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 461}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/26/arts/18koreanart-notebook01/merlin_173595993_d2308854-af52-407b-a6c9-1e8f92b04a8c-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 786, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/26/arts/18koreanart-notebook01/merlin_173595993_d2308854-af52-407b-a6c9-1e8f92b04a8c-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1572, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo',