': 'Hispanic-Americans', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Romero, Regina', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Police', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Tucson (Ariz)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Police Department (Tucson, Ariz)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Video Recordings, Downloads and Streaming', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-06-25T23:51:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Simon Romero, Giulia McDonnell Nieto del Rio and Nicholas Bogel-Burroughs', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Simon', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Romero', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Giulia', 'middlename': 'Mcdonnell', 'lastname': 'Nieto', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/fe74ccae-1565-51bb-bcd0-97b096bbdcdd', 'word_count': 1422, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fe74ccae-1565-51bb-bcd0-97b096bbdcdd'}, {'abstract': 'This is not the time to obsess about symbolism.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/06/25/opinion/us-coronavirus-protests.html', 'snippet': 'This is not the time to obsess about symbolism.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There are five gigantic changes happening in America right now. The first is that we are losing the fight against Covid-19. Our behavior doesn’t have anything to do with the reality around us. We just got tired so we’re giving up.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '27', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/27/opinion/25brooksWeb/merlin_173727378_812b7d4e-3b86-4952-8daf-dc0aa7cd78e9-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge'