': 'nyt://article/df7c64dd-b3e7-5a8f-b470-80f976207491'}, {'abstract': 'We barely spoke. He didn’t charge me. I’ll never forget it.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/06/26/style/modern-love-coronavirus-as-he-cut-my-hair-i-wept.html', 'snippet': 'We barely spoke. He didn’t charge me. I’ll never forget it.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A few weeks ago, I gave myself a crew cut. I didn’t know how long it would be before I could visit a barber and figured I might as well do it myself.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/28/fashion/28MODERN-HAIRCUT/28MODERN-HAIRCUT-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 379, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/06/28/fashion/28MODERN-HAIRCUT/28MODERN-HAIRCUT-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 379}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/28/fashion/28MODERN-HAIRCUT/28MODERN-HAIRCUT-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 647, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/28/fashion/28MODERN-HAIRCUT/28MODERN-HAIRCUT-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1294, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/28/fashion/28MODERN-HAIRCUT/28MODERN-HAIRCUT-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/06/28/fashion/28MODERN-HAIRCUT/28MODERN-HAIRCUT-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/20