 1603, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fb69a1ca-6fe1-508c-a846-54493d768cbe'}, {'abstract': 'Giving has surged during the coronavirus crisis, eclipsing donations during the 2008 recession and after the Sept. 11 terrorist attacks, two reports show.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/06/26/your-money/philanthropy-pandemic-coronavirus.html', 'snippet': 'Giving has surged during the coronavirus crisis, eclipsing donations during the 2008 recession and after the Sept. 11 terrorist attacks, two reports show.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When the coronavirus prompted states to order residents to stay at home in March, unemployment surged around the country as huge parts of the economy slowed or stopped. Soon after, there were calls for philanthropists, charitably inclined people and even occasional donors to accelerate any giving they were planning to do.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/26/business/26Virus-Wealth-01/merlin_173895609_2b54be32-dd16-4f4f-8048-da15c4278797-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/06/26/business/26Virus-Wealth-01/merlin_173895609_2b54be32-dd16-4f4f-8048-da15c4278797-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/26/business/26Virus-Wealth-01/merlin_173895609_2b54be32-dd16-4f4f-8048-da15c4278797-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/26/business/26Virus-Wealth-01/merlin_173895609_2b54be32-dd16-4f4f-8048-da15c4278797-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legac