tical activism and trolling. It has homegrown pundits, and despite its parent company’s reluctance to be involved with politics — the service does not allow political ads —\xa0it has attracted interest from campaigns. It is also a space where people can be gathered and pressed into action quickly.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/25/fashion/25TIKTOK-POLITICS-teens-protest/25TIKTOK-POLITICS-teens-protest-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 308, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/06/25/fashion/25TIKTOK-POLITICS-teens-protest/25TIKTOK-POLITICS-teens-protest-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 308}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/25/fashion/25TIKTOK-POLITICS-teens-protest/25TIKTOK-POLITICS-teens-protest-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 525, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/25/fashion/25TIKTOK-POLITICS-teens-protest/25TIKTOK-POLITICS-teens-protest-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1051, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/25/fashion/25TIKTOK-POLITICS-teens-protest/25TIKTOK-POLITICS-teens-protest-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/06/25/fashion/25TIKTOK-POLITICS-teens-protest/25TIKTOK-POLITICS-teens-protest-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/25/fashion/25TIKTOK-POLITICS-teens-protest/