one Liu Keqing has spent his career delighting fans in opera houses and on social media, but lately his likeness has attracted the Chinese authorities’ attention.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/06/29/world/asia/china-xi-jinping-opera-lookalike.html', 'snippet': 'The baritone Liu Keqing has spent his career delighting fans in opera houses and on social media, but lately his likeness has attracted the Chinese authorities’ attention.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The long stares and startled whispers — Is that him? — begin as soon as Liu Keqing, an imposing Chinese baritone, enters any room in China. With a square face, closely cropped black hair and a portly figure, Mr. Liu bears a striking resemblance to Xi Jinping, China’s top leader.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/29/world/00xi-lookalike-promo/merlin_174033462_8b8536b7-2d98-413a-8138-d1c9fed550bd-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 446, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/06/29/world/00xi-lookalike-promo/merlin_174033462_8b8536b7-2d98-413a-8138-d1c9fed550bd-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 446}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/29/world/00xi-lookalike-promo/merlin_174033462_8b8536b7-2d98-413a-8138-d1c9fed550bd-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 760, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/29/world/00xi-lookalike-promo/merlin_174033462_8b8536b7-2d98-413a-8138-d1c9fed550bd-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1500, 'width': 2020, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': '