pring, instrument dealers around the country report surprise at the robust numbers.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/06/29/arts/music/piano-sales-coronavirus.html', 'snippet': 'With their showrooms closed this spring, instrument dealers around the country report surprise at the robust numbers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When the coronavirus sequestered Americans at home and forced businesses to close, Hale Ryan braced himself for a financial winter. As the director of sales and marketing at Metroplex Piano in Dallas and a 30-year veteran of the piano business, he had seen other crises — like 9/11 and the 2008 recession — damage sales. When the lockdown began in March, Mr. Ryan said in a recent phone interview, “I thought this was going to be the final nail.”', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/30/arts/29piano-sales-2/merlin_173897406_ec4c737a-e418-463c-93f9-7df4b04d532f-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 750, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/06/30/arts/29piano-sales-2/merlin_173897406_ec4c737a-e418-463c-93f9-7df4b04d532f-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 750}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/30/arts/29piano-sales-2/merlin_173897406_ec4c737a-e418-463c-93f9-7df4b04d532f-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 820, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/30/arts/29piano-sales-2/merlin_173897406_ec4c737a-e418-463c-93f9-7df4b04d532f-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1639, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 