03e'}, {'abstract': 'Zachary David Levy pays tribute to a formidable woman — two, actually — in his New York Times Crossword debut.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/06/29/crosswords/daily-puzzle-2020-06-30.html', 'snippet': 'Zachary David Levy pays tribute to a formidable woman — two, actually — in his New York Times Crossword debut.', 'lead_paragraph': 'TUESDAY PUZZLE — Now this is a great tribute puzzle: It’s a crossed-word homage to someone who has fought tirelessly for the ideals of our country, instead of a Hollywood figure. It’s also a well-made debut by Zachary David Levy and, as a cherry on the sundae, it’s a sort of love letter to his wife.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/30/crosswords/30wordplay-supremecourt/30wordplay-supremecourt-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 366, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/06/30/crosswords/30wordplay-supremecourt/30wordplay-supremecourt-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 366}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/30/crosswords/30wordplay-supremecourt/30wordplay-supremecourt-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 624, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/30/crosswords/30wordplay-supremecourt/30wordplay-supremecourt-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 624, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/30/crosswords/30wordplay-supremecourt/30wordplay-supremecourt-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/