ltations, prepaid shipping labels for trying on and returning gowns and sample dresses. There is also personalized help available from stylists who can pull a selection of gowns based on your style preference and assist you in taking measurements. Here are a few shopping options to help you find your wedding day look online.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/30/fashion/30VIRTUALDRESSSHOP-art/30VIRTUALDRESSSHOP-art-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/06/30/fashion/30VIRTUALDRESSSHOP-art/30VIRTUALDRESSSHOP-art-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/30/fashion/30VIRTUALDRESSSHOP-art/30VIRTUALDRESSSHOP-art-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/30/fashion/30VIRTUALDRESSSHOP-art/30VIRTUALDRESSSHOP-art-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1280, 'width': 1280, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/30/fashion/30VIRTUALDRESSSHOP-art/30VIRTUALDRESSSHOP-art-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/06/30/fashion/30VIRTUALDRESSSHOP-art/30VIRTUALDRESSSHOP-art-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/30/fashion/30VIRTUALDRESSSHOP-art/30VIRTUALDRESSSHOP-art-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height