g $100 Million  To Empower Black Banks', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Banking and Financial Institutions', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Income Inequality', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Netflix Inc', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Baradaran, Mehrsa (1978- )', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hastings, Reed', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-06-30T13:44:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'DealBook', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael J. de la Merced', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': 'J.', 'lastname': 'de la Merced', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/65a5c2c6-808a-597e-bfde-eb8eac87ae52', 'word_count': 567, 'uri': 'nyt://article/65a5c2c6-808a-597e-bfde-eb8eac87ae52'}, {'abstract': 'Thank you to the teenagers who participated this week, and congratulations to our winner, Ula Ekmecic, as well as our many runners-up and honorable mentions.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/06/30/learning/summer-reading-contest-winner-week-1-on-im-a-black-american-i-had-to-get-out.html', 'snippet': 'Thank you to the teenagers who participated this week, and congratulations to our winner, Ula Ekmecic, as well as our many runners-up and honorable mentions.', 'lead_paragraph': 'We received 868 entries from students from around the world for the first week of our 10-week Summer Reading Contest. Thank you to everyone who participated, and congratulations to our winner, Ula Ekmecic, as well as the 11 runners-up and 16 honorable mentions we honor below. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'image