read protests in 2017. He had been exiled in France until October, when he traveled to Iraq and then disappeared.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/06/30/world/middleeast/ruhollah-zam-iran.html', 'snippet': 'Ruhollah Zam once ran a popular news service that helped share information about the widespread protests in 2017. He had been exiled in France until October, when he traveled to Iraq and then disappeared.', 'lead_paragraph': 'An Iranian opposition journalist who played an active role in widespread protests that engulfed the country in 2017 and 2018 has been sentenced to death, Iranian authorities said on Tuesday, months after he disappeared in neighboring Iraq and ended up in his home country under murky conditions.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/30/world/30iran-sentence1/merlin_174064371_c73642ce-198a-4e1e-8ff6-ffa5fd21c1e9-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/06/30/world/30iran-sentence1/merlin_174064371_c73642ce-198a-4e1e-8ff6-ffa5fd21c1e9-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/30/world/30iran-sentence1/merlin_174064371_c73642ce-198a-4e1e-8ff6-ffa5fd21c1e9-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/30/world/30iran-sentence1/merlin_174064371_c73642ce-198a-4e1e-8ff6-ffa5fd21c1e9-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/30/world/30iran-sentence1/merlin_174064371_c73642ce