nstant barrage of juxtaposing feelings. My foray into motherhood wasn’t tainted by loss, it was enhanced by it.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I was 19 weeks pregnant when an emergency room on-call Ob-Gyn looked me in the eyes and told me that Twin A’s heart had stopped beating. Twin A — my future son — who had a name that I cannot, to this day, say out loud.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/30/multimedia/30parenting-twin-loss/30parenting-twin-loss-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 750, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/06/30/multimedia/30parenting-twin-loss/30parenting-twin-loss-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 750}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/30/multimedia/30parenting-twin-loss/30parenting-twin-loss-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 900, 'width': 720, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/30/multimedia/30parenting-twin-loss/30parenting-twin-loss-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 900, 'width': 720, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/30/multimedia/30parenting-twin-loss/30parenting-twin-loss-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/06/30/multimedia/30parenting-twin-loss/30parenting-twin-loss-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/30/multimedia/30parenting-twin-loss/30parenting-twin-loss-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'When Motherhood Means Carrying Life and Death', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parenting', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Pregnancy and Childbirth', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Miscarriages', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Twins', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-06-30T17:30:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Parenting', 'section_name': 'Parenting', 'subsection_name': 'Pregnancy', 'byline': {'original': 'By Danielle Campoamor', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Danielle', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Campoamor', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5b2dbfac-38aa-50e3-bb80-e1beece5abab', 'word_count': 1009, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5b2dbfac-38aa-50e3-bb80-e1beece5abab'}, {'abstract': 'The filmed version of Lin-Manuel Miranda’s founding-father Broadway musical arrives just in time — vital and more challenging than ever.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/06/30/movies/hamilton-review-disney-plus.html', 'snippet': 'The filmed version of Lin-Manuel Miranda’s founding-father Broadway musical arrives just in time — vital and more challenging than ever.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The opening scenes of the filmed version of the Broadway musical “Hamilton,” which starts streaming on Disney+ on Independence Day weekend, pull you back in time to two distinct periods. The people onstage, in their breeches and brass-buttoned coats, belong to the New York of 1776. That’s when a 19-year-old freshly arrived from the Caribbean — the “bastard, immigrant, son of a whore” who shares his name with the show — makes his move and takes his shot, joining up with a squad of anti-British revolutionaries and eventually finding his way to George Washington’s right hand and the front of the $10 bill.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/07/03/arts/02hamilton-review1/merlin_173874303_3b621c7a-0873-4d4c-989f-0b512205e5d0-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/07/03/arts/02hamilton-review1/merlin_173874303_3b621c7a-0873-4d4c-989f-0b512205e5d0-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 338}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/07/03/arts/02hamilton-review1/merlin_173874303_3b621c7a-0873-4d4c-989f-0b512205e5d0-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 576, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/07/03/arts/02hamilton-review1/merlin_173874303_3b621c7a-0873-4d4c-989f-0b512205e5d0-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1152, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/07/03/arts/02hamilton-review1/02hamilton-review1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/07/03/arts/02hamilton-review1/02hamilton-review1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/07/03/arts/02hamilton-review1/02hamilton-review1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '‘Hamilton’ Revi