Griffith.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/06/30/sports/baseball/rod-carew-minneapolis-george-floyd-protests.html', 'snippet': 'A former Times columnist was struck by Rod Carew’s encounters with the police decades ago while playing with the Twins, and his outlook now on the legacy of the former owner Calvin Griffith.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The tumult of recent weeks has made my thoughts turn to Rod Carew, whose past life as a Minnesota Twin speaks to present days in Minneapolis, and the country.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/07/01/sports/30berkow-carew-2/merlin_156612324_ad4791de-b2e6-4309-bcd8-84ed545cff87-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 407, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/07/01/sports/30berkow-carew-2/merlin_156612324_ad4791de-b2e6-4309-bcd8-84ed545cff87-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 407}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/07/01/sports/30berkow-carew-2/merlin_156612324_ad4791de-b2e6-4309-bcd8-84ed545cff87-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 694, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/07/01/sports/30berkow-carew-2/merlin_156612324_ad4791de-b2e6-4309-bcd8-84ed545cff87-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1388, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/07/01/sports/30berkow-carew-2/30berkow-carew-2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/07/01/sports/30berkow-carew-2/30berkow-carew-2-thumbSt